# Server-side env vars for Solarchik (set them in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables).
# Never prefix a secret with VITE_: anything VITE_* is baked into the browser bundle.

# --- Database (Neon / Postgres). Required for arb caps, arb credit, fee verification, Pro payment checks. ---
# Without it on a deploy: arb firing, arb credit and fee verification are CLOSED. Mints still work with
# MINT_AUTHORITY_SECRET (deterministic asset addresses stop doubles); without both, Pro and Free are closed.
# Or leave it empty when the Vercel Neon integration is linked: the server then reads POSTGRES_URL.
DATABASE_URL=

# --- Strategy NFT mint (devnet) ---
# Server mint authority: base58 secret key (64 bytes or 32-byte seed) or a JSON byte array. Devnet key; it pays nothing
# (the room wallet pays rent and fees), so it does not need SOL. The server collection key is derived from it.
# Set: every mint is co-signed by the server (Pro needs a verified 0.1 SOL payment, Free one per wallet).
# Set: arb only accepts agents from the server collection; older agents use "Move to server collection" (re-issue).
# Unset on a deploy: Pro is closed with a clear message (nothing charged); Free mints from the browser after the
# server's on-chain check only when DATABASE_URL is set (slot lock), else closed. Unset under `vite dev`: both mint from the browser.
# The devnet demo Strategy NFTs (docs/devnet-strategy-run.md) are in collection 74Tyscw6gL9mDxvNsSSDuj6v4YHqFPCyUULirjLPeuQC,
# derived from authority 8eKeV2Vh7QhGHjsTgQN2m938iyeALqsGyhSiNQRJAxR3: the app only shows them when this is that key
# (and DATABASE_URL holds their listings).
# It now pays for results writes / thaws / unlists and the judge faucet fallback: keep ~0.5 devnet SOL on it.
MINT_AUTHORITY_SECRET=

# --- Arb desk ---
# Mainnet arb stays OFF unless this is exactly "true" AND DATABASE_URL is set.
# Unset = simulation on the live Backpack book, nothing signed or sent, arb credit not spent.
ARB_MAINNET_ENABLED=
# Mainnet arb house secrets. Without them mainnet refuses (simulation still works without them).
# Treasury wallet secret (base58 or JSON array); its public key must be H7zKmmnMNfnsMtib6mopdT8XsPYAyPBFuaQeWhBYTpQg.
ARB_HOUSE_KEY=
# Backpack API key and its base64 ed25519 secret (the two lines of the old server/backpack.secret).
BACKPACK_API_KEY=
BACKPACK_SECRET=
# Titan API key (TITAN_API_KEY is also accepted).
TITAN_SECRET=
# The old files server/arb-house.key, server/backpack.secret, server/titan.secret are read only under `vite dev`.

# --- Solana RPC (optional; public nodes when unset). Keep provider tokens here, never in source. ---
SOLANA_RPC_DEVNET=
SOLANA_RPC_MAINNET=

# --- Cloudflare desk worker token. Server only; injected by /api/desk/* and server functions. ---
# Must equal the DESK_TOKEN secret on the solarchik-desk worker. Rotate it (the old one is in git history).
DESK_TOKEN=
# Optional: extra browser origins allowed to call /api/desk/* (comma separated). Same origin is always allowed.
# Add the native WebView origin here (for example https://localhost) so the Android bundle can reach the desk.
DESK_PROXY_ORIGINS=

# --- Build-time, public (not a secret) ---
# Only for the native/offline web bundle: absolute origin of the deployed app that serves /api/desk/* and
# /api/native/* (arb fire, arb house, mint). Default: https://solarchik-market.vercel.app
VITE_DESK_PROXY_ORIGIN=

# --- Existing keys used elsewhere (unchanged) ---
XAI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
